┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  Aira [Terminal] [Files] [Editor] [Settings]  [Task List]  [1][2][3][4]  │
│                                                                            │
│  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │                                                                    │   │
│  │   Right-click anywhere on the desktop background for the menu!   │   │
│  │                                                                    │   │
│  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
│                                                                            │
│  NET: 10.0.2.15    DSK: 2.1G free (45% used)    CPU ████░░░░░░░  14:32  │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Top Bar (left to right):
• "Aira" button / Alt+F1 → Main application menu
• Quick launch: Terminal, Files, Editor, Settings
• Running applications (task list)
• Workspace switcher (1,2,3,4)
• Network status, Disk status, CPU load, Clock

Keyboard Shortcuts:
• Alt+F1  → Main menu
• Alt+F2  → Terminal
• Alt+F3  → File Manager
• Alt+F4  → Text Editor
• Alt+F5  → Settings
• Alt+F6  → System Monitor
• Alt+F7  → Network Manager
• Alt+F8  → Package Center
• Alt+F9  → About
• Alt+Tab → Switch windows
• Alt+F4  → Close window
• Ctrl+Esc → Main menu

Try it now! Right-click on the desktop → Terminal
TOUR_EOF
    fi
fi

# Mark welcome as done
touch "$WELCOME_FLAG"
echo "Welcome screen completed."